# Copy to .env.local for local development. Values are injected at build time by
# Vite, and only variables prefixed with VITE_ reach the browser.
#
# Collector credentials are NOT set here — they are real secrets and must never
# be inlined into a client bundle. They come from your shell environment
# locally and from repository secrets in Actions. See the README.

# Read the library from another deployment's feed instead of this site's own
# copy. Useful for working on the front end without collecting anything.
# VITE_DATA_URL=https://<user>.github.io/<repo>/data/games.json
